{
  "name": "Arduino Nano Breakout",
  "description": "A clean breakout board for the Arduino Nano that exposes all I/O pins on 0.1\" pitch headers, adds a barrel-jack power input, a decoupling capacitor bank, and four mounting holes. Ideal first board for makers moving from breadboard to PCB.",
